      "judgment_rationale": "Desktop now routes Tenant Tasks through one generation-backed V2 Provider. Cloud reads the tenant-wide stats, queue and recent projections and keeps retry, stop and retry-pending behind a tenant lease and vault-bound transport; Local reads only the selected project's My Work projection behind a project lease and rejects Cloud mutations before acquisition. Both transports are observed rather than renderer-declared, but neither response supplies a snapshot-wide authority revision. Snapshot v4 therefore intentionally closes both surfaces to capability_authority_revision_unavailable and promotes no action until Cloud provides one tenant/principal-scoped coherent snapshot revision and the sidecar provides one project-scoped My Work snapshot revision."
